{% comment %}
日志 rizhi：观测日志的扉页。页眉是 2px 墨线上的日志抬头，左落款（presenter，600）右日期（等宽数字）；主标题宋体 200、display 档，按 5 字一行折两行，压在画面下三分之二；副题 lead ink-2 在标题下。
朱色：无。整页只有字和一条墨线，像日志本翻开的第一页。入场：标题先升起，副题洇出，页眉最后。
{% endcomment %}
<style>
  :scope {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: var(--ds-space-6) var(--ds-space-7);
    background: var(--ds-color-paper);
    color: var(--ds-color-ink);
    font-family: var(--ds-font-body);
    text-spacing-trim: trim-both;
  }
  :scope::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    opacity: .45;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='240' height='240'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/><feColorMatrix values='0 0 0 0 .30 0 0 0 0 .24 0 0 0 0 .17 0 0 0 .16 0'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
  }
  p, h1, h2, ol, ul, li, figure, figcaption, blockquote { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  p, li, blockquote { text-wrap: pretty; }
  h1, h2 { text-wrap: balance; }
  .run {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--ds-space-5);
    padding-bottom: var(--ds-space-2);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ds-color-ink);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-caption);
    letter-spacing: .16em;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ds-color-ink-2);
  }
  .run b { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-color-ink); }
  .run .date { font-feature-settings: "lnum" 1, "tnum" 1; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .main {
    position: absolute;
    left: var(--ds-space-7);
    right: var(--ds-space-7);
    bottom: var(--ds-space-8);
  }
  .title {
    width: 5.3em;
    text-wrap: wrap;
    font-family: var(--ds-font-cjk);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-display);
    font-weight: 200;
    letter-spacing: .02em;
    line-height: 1.14;
  }
  .subtitle {
    margin-top: var(--ds-space-6);
    max-width: 24em;
    font-size: var(--ds-type-lead);
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ds-color-ink-2);
  }
  .subtitle:has(> :empty) { display: none; }
</style>
<div class="run" data-ds-enter="fade" data-ds-step="ink" data-ds-ease="ink" data-ds-order="3"><b>{{ slots.presenter }}</b><span class="date">{{ slots.date }}</span></div>
<div class="main">
  <h1 class="title" data-ds-enter="rise" data-ds-step="glide" data-ds-ease="paper" data-ds-distance="3" data-ds-order="1">{{ slots.title }}</h1>
  <p class="subtitle" data-ds-enter="fade" data-ds-step="ink" data-ds-ease="ink" data-ds-order="2">{{ slots.subtitle }}</p>
</div>
